  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Sky Manipulation — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally, at 18th level,  you have learned the most powerful technique of your arsenal. Your domain is a beautiful blue sky full of clouds, with a shining sun illuminating everything. All hostile creatures inside the domain are considered falling unless they have flying speed. Once the domain is over, they take the maximum amount of falling damage.</p>",
